//! `list` subcommand: list commits in a jj repo, one per line:
//! changeID + ochid (padded) + bookmarks + title, the anchor bolded.
//!
//! - `ListArgs`: clap surface, and flattens
//!   `options_flags::common_args::CommonArgs` plus a `-w`/`--width`
